{
    "meetJp": [
        {
            "text": "Hello, I am John Paul M. Yap! I am a 3rd year Bachelor of Science in Information Technology student, studying at the University of San Carlos. \n\nI love to play video games such as &bOverwatch, Minecraft, VALORANT, Roblox, &fand more! I also love to listen to music, and my favorite genres are &aR&&aB, pop, rock, and hip-hop. &fSome of my favorite artists are &bGood Kid, INOHA, Ben&Ben, Last Dinosaurs, The Doozers and Phoneboy.\n\n&fWant to know more about me? Go to the next pages to read more about my education and journey to becoming a developer!"    
        },
        {
            "text": "My Junior High School and Senior High School were at &bUniversity of San Carlos - North Campus.&f from 2018 until 2024. I had always enjoyed &aproblem solving and logical thinking &f especially with math-related subjects, however I was also interested in technology and figured that I could apply my skills in the field of %aprogramming %f. I loved dealing with difficult problems that required me to rack my brain to think of solutions for through systematic thinking.\n\nI am currently studying at &bUniversity of San Carlos&f for college so I can further develop my skills and become a capable and dependable programmer in the future."
        }        
    ],
